# Forbidden Process Kill Commands

## 🚫 NEVER

- NEVER use `pkill -f "pattern"`.
- NEVER use `kill $(pgrep -f "pattern")`.
- NEVER use `pgrep -f "pattern" | xargs kill`.
- NEVER pass `pgrep -f` output to any kill command.

Reason: `-f` matches full command lines and can kill the agent shell or unrelated processes.